{%- comment -%}
  Product-page wrapper around `ona-product-tags`.

  Shows the same scheduled promo badges the product cards show, in the PDP's
  left-aligned treatment. Every product page — Horizon block, product-template-2
  and product-template-3 — renders badges through here, so the schedule, colour
  and expiry rules only ever live in `ona-product-tags`.

  Renders NOTHING when no badge is active. That matters: the older inline copies
  always emitted their wrapper, so a product with no live promo still got an
  empty div and a gap under the price.

  Usage: {% render 'ona-product-tags-pdp', product: product %}

  @param {object} product  - the product to read custom_product.* metafields from
  @param {string} class    - optional extra classes on the wrapper
  @param {string} style    - optional inline style on the wrapper
  @param {string} attrs    - optional raw attributes (e.g. block.shopify_attributes)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture ona_pdp_tags -%}{%- render 'ona-product-tags', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign ona_pdp_tags_trimmed = ona_pdp_tags | strip -%}
{%- if ona_pdp_tags_trimmed != blank -%}
  <div class="product_single_custom_tag_black{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"{% if style != blank %} style="{{ style }}"{% endif %} {{ attrs }}>{{ ona_pdp_tags }}</div>
{%- endif -%}
